    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cormac Sheehy is delighted to present this fantastic Grant Eligible Property to the market. \n\nThis established neighborhood is well-regarded for its community spirit and friendly atmosphere, making it an excellent choice for families, first-time buyers, or those wishing to downsize without compromising on location.\n\nJust steps from Main Street, residents can enjoy immediate access to local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and essential services. The motorway is within easy reach, providing direct connectivity to Dublin in around an hour.\n\nThe property itself is full of character and warmth. A neatly designed front garden with low-maintenance paving and planting sets the tone, while the iron gate adds a charming touch.\n\nInside, the ground floor flows easily between bright and welcoming spaces. The kitchen, overlooking the rear garden, features a solid-fuel stove with back boiler that brings both comfort and efficiency. The separate front lounge offers a relaxing retreat, finished with wood flooring.\n\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms two doubles and one single fitted with wardrobes to maximise storage.\n\nTo the rear, a generous yard and outbuilding with independent access provide further flexibility, whether for storage, hobbies, or future enhancement.\n\n20 Ave Maria Park is a property that balances charm, practicality, and a prime address an opportunity not to be missed.\nThis house should qualify for Vacant Homes Scheme.\n\n\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
